    "Requirement: model/provider-related activity. Tier ladder: Copper 10000, Silver 30000, Gold 80000, Diamond 200000, Olympian 500000.": "要求：模型/提供方相关活动。等级阶梯：Copper 10000，Silver 30000，Gold 80000，Diamond 200000，Olympian 500000。",
